                        <li class="mb-1.5">A <strong>Gartner study*</strong> found that companies that provide total compensation statements to their employees have a <span style="background-color:yellow">50% lower turnover risk</span> than companies that did not. The study also found that employees who received them were more likely to be engaged in their work and to feel that they were fairly compensated.</li>
